    thinking: "**Refining Automated Analysis**\n\nI\'m focusing on streamlining the image analysis workflow. My goal is for the backend analysis (`handleAnalyze`) to be automatically triggered as soon as an image is captured (either through upload/selection or direct capture). I am currently thinking about implementing this by linking the image acquisition (`handleFileChange`) or equivalent event directly to the analysis process.\n\n\n"
